  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Primary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Compact primary action for import or saving a correction.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-primary\">Import statements</button>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{font:13px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;min-height:26px;padding:3px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line,#d4d4d8);border-radius:5px;line-height:18px;cursor:default;background:var(--selected,#0066d9);color:#fff;border-color:var(--selected,#0066d9)}.ds-primary:hover{background:#0054ba}.ds-primary:active{background:var(--selection,#dceaff)}.ds-primary:disabled{opacity:.5}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#0066d9);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Secondary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
      "description": "Neutral compact action without a primary fill.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-secondary\">Open finished files</button>",
      "css": ".ds-secondary{font:13px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;min-height:26px;padding:3px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line,#d4d4d8);border-radius:5px;line-height:18px;cursor:default;background:var(--control,#fff);color:var(--ink,#1d1d1f)}.ds-secondary:hover{background:var(--hover,#e3e3e7)}.ds-secondary:active{background:var(--selection,#dceaff)}.ds-secondary:disabled{opacity:.5}.ds-secondary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#0066d9);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Transaction Search",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "search-field",
      "description": "Browser-native search input inside the compact document toolbar.",
      "html": "<input class=\"ds-search\" type=\"search\" aria-label=\"Search transactions\" placeholder=\"Search transactions\">",
      "css": ".ds-search{font:13px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;min-height:26px;padding:3px 7px;border:1px solid var(--line,#d4d4d8);border-radius:6px;background:var(--control,#fff);color:var(--ink,#1d1d1f);caret-color:var(--accent,#0066d9)}.ds-search::placeholder{color:var(--muted,#5b5b61);opacity:1}.ds-search:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#0066d9);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Selected Document",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "document-selected",
      "description": "Library row with an inline document icon and secondary progress label.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-document\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 20\"><path d=\"M3 1.5h7l5 5v12H3zM10 1.5v5h5M6 10h6M6 13h6\"/></svg><span>Statement PDF<small>Finished · pages read</small></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-document{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;width:210px;padding:8px;border:0;border-radius:5px;background:var(--selected,#0066d9);color:var(--selected-ink,#fff);font:13px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;text-align:left;line-height:17px}.ds-document svg{width:16px;height:18px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex-shrink:0}.ds-document small{display:block;margin-top:3px;font-size:11px;color:var(--selected-muted,#e5efff);line-height:15px}.ds-document:hover{background:var(--selected,#0066d9)}.ds-document:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#0066d9);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Unresolved Check Tag",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "warning-tag",
      "description": "Text and amber together identify financial errors or estimated financial values and dates. Information-only notes remain separately accessible.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-warning\">Financial checks</span>",
      "css": ".ds-warning{display:inline-block;padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--warning-surface,#fff1ce);color:var(--warning,#805000);font:10px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Source Evidence Container",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "evidence-card",
      "description": "Source imagery occupies the first region above extracted financial values. Financial checks contain concrete financial errors and estimated values or dates. Names, AI narration and other information notes remain available separately, without removing warnings or changing transaction values. The snippet labels its image slot instead of embedding private evidence.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-evidence\"><figure><div class=\"ds-source-slot\">Source image slot</div><figcaption>Source crop · page reference</figcaption></figure><section><h3>Financial check</h3><p>Extracted values appear beneath their source.</p></section></article>",
      "css": ".ds-evidence{max-width:900px;border:1px solid var(--line,#d4d4d8);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#1d1d1f);font:13px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif}.ds-evidence figure{margin:0;padding:12px;background:var(--subtle,#f1f1f3);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#d4d4d8)}.ds-source-slot{padding:30px 12px;background:#fff;color:#5b5b61}.ds-evidence figcaption{margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted,#5b5b61);font-size:11px}.ds-evidence section{padding:16px}.ds-evidence h3{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.ds-evidence p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#5b5b61)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Estimated Property",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "A flat property value keeps its estimate label and origin explanation visible.",
      "html": "<dl class=\"ds-properties\"><div><dt>Balance <span>Estimated</span></dt><dd>Extracted value<small>Inferred value; not confirmed as printed.</small></dd></div></dl>",
      "css": ".ds-properties{margin:0;color:var(--ink,#1d1d1f);font:13px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif}.ds-properties dt{font-size:11px;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted,#5b5b61);line-height:1.5}.ds-properties dt span{margin-left:5px;color:var(--warning,#805000)}.ds-properties dd{margin:4px 0 0;line-height:1.5}.ds-properties small{display:block;margin-top:3px;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted,#5b5b61)}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Native Mac Document Utility",
    "overview": "The user selected native macOS appearance and conventions. The shipped interface combines an AppKit window, menus, unified compact toolbar and file panels with a compact WKWebView document workspace. System typography, neutral surfaces and blue selection place the document and its evidence ahead of decorative identity.\n\nThe workspace remains dense enough for statement processing while keeping uncertain values readable. Scan images appear before extracted fields. Light and dark appearance follow the system by default, with app-specific Light and Dark options in the View menu. White scan paper retains its original appearance in both themes.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Actual AppKit window controls, toolbar icons, menus and file panels.",
      "System typography and compact neutral controls.",
      "Independent library and workspace scroll panes.",
      "Full-width source evidence above flat property fields.",
      "Explicit amber uncertainty and red error states."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Source Paper Rule",
        "body": "Scan imagery remains white-backed and uninverted in both appearances.",
        "section": "colors"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use actual AppKit controls for window, toolbar, menus and file panels.",
      "Do preserve compact system typography and blue selection in both appearances.",
      "Do show source imagery above uncertain values at a readable width.",
      "Do retain semantic labels alongside color for every unresolved reading.",
      "Do keep library and workspace scrolling independent."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't add simulated macOS traffic lights or duplicate the native toolbar in HTML.",
      "Don't invert scan paper when changing appearance.",
      "Don't present arithmetic agreement or an OCR score as proof of source accuracy.",
      "Don't turn optional inspection, confirmation or layout controls into completion gates.",
      "Don't replace the selected native Mac conventions with marketing typography or decorative animation."
    ]
  }
}
